# shiso-official-logprob-vectors-v1
# label parser-conformance-only
# captured_from none
# PARSER CONFORMANCE ONLY. Synthetic numbers, no model, never replayed.
# Tokens here are hex-encoded UTF-8 bytes rather than ids, because the kind of
# source this grammar exists for - a hosted endpoint that returns text and
# log-probabilities - has no token ids to give. 416461 is "Ada".
# case <id> <ctx> <steps> <prompt-file>
# step <index> <selected-hex> <top-count>
# top <token-hex> <logprob>
case sample_bytes 16384 2 ../prompts/short_italian_fact.txt
step 0 416461 2
top 416461 0
top 416461626f -1.25
step 1 204c6f76 1
top 204c6f76 0
end
